BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-13-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260713T110000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:111500
SUMMARY:POST: An AI runs this page
DESCRIPTION:Format: carousel | Pillar: story | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nConfession: an AI agent plans\, writes and designs every post on this page. I set it up in one afternoon and it cost me R0.\n\nI am a designer\, not a programmer. If I can build this\, you can.\n\nThis account is now a live experiment: can an AI run a page to 10K followers? I will publish the real numbers\, including the flops.\n\nComment SYSTEM and I will send you the exact breakdown. Guess what it cost before you swipe to slide 6.\n\n#ai #aiagent #claudeai #buildinpublic #automation #contentcreator #aiforbeginners #digitalskills #techsouthafrica #learnai
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: An AI runs this page
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-14-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260714T110000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:111500
SUMMARY:POST: Same task\, two prompts\, wildly different results
DESCRIPTION:Format: carousel | Pillar: prompts | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nA client asked me to halve my price. I gave the exact same problem to AI twice. Slide 3 folded instantly. Slide 4 is the reply I actually sent.\n\nThe difference was never the AI. It was the brief.\n\nA or B on slide 6? Answer in the comments\, I want the honest one.\n\nSend this to a freelancer who needs it today.\n\n#freelance #pricing #aiprompts #claudeai #freelancetips #smallbusiness #promptengineering #ai #designbusiness #techsouthafrica
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: Same task\, two prompts\, wildly different results
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-15-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260715T190000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:191500
SUMMARY:POST: The AI fluency quiz
DESCRIPTION:Format: carousel | Pillar: basics | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nMost people using AI daily score 2 out of 4 on this. The words are easy. The mechanics behind them are what save you from embarrassing mistakes.\n\nRules: guess before you swipe\, count honestly\, comment your score.\n\nMy favourite wrong answer so far: AI lies because it got bored. It did not. Slide 4 explains what actually happens.\n\nTag someone who needs this quiz.\n\n#aiquiz #ai #aiforbeginners #learnai #claudeai #artificialintelligence #techtok #aiexplained #digitalskills #techsouthafrica
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: The AI fluency quiz
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-16-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260716T110000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:111500
SUMMARY:POST: The ten minute AI test drive
DESCRIPTION:Format: carousel | Pillar: claude | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nDo not pick your AI because a YouTuber shouted about it. Run the ten minute test drive on your own real work.\n\nThree rounds: your longest document\, your voice\, and the honesty test on slide 5 that almost nobody runs.\n\nI ran it. My result and the round that decided it are on slide 7.\n\nComment which AI wins YOUR test. Genuinely curious about round 3 results.\n\n#claudeai #chatgpt #aitools #ai #aicomparison #learnai #promptengineering #aiforbeginners #digitalskills #aitips
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: The ten minute AI test drive
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-17-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260717T110000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:111500
SUMMARY:POST: One day\, R0\, full brand: the receipts
DESCRIPTION:Format: carousel | Pillar: story | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nOne day. R0. This exact brand: the site you can visit\, the logo on this post\, the kit behind every slide.\n\nHour by hour receipts inside\, including the actual brief I typed at 09:00.\n\nThe checklist on slide 7 is your weekend version. Screenshot it\, build yours\, tag me in the result. I will share the best ones on my story.\n\nComment BRAND for the exact prompts\, word for word.\n\n#buildinpublic #aidesign #branding #claudeai #graphicdesign #freelancedesigner #sidehustle #southafricandesigner #aitools #designtips
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: One day\, R0\, full brand: the receipts
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-18-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260718T100000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:101500
SUMMARY:POST: Unpopular opinion: most AI content is noise
DESCRIPTION:Format: quote | Pillar: brand | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nUnpopular opinion for your Saturday.\n\nMost AI content is recycled tips nobody tested\, posted by people who have never shipped anything with the tools they praise.\n\nThe fix is receipts. Show the task\, show the failure\, show the result. That is the standard I am holding this page to\, and you should hold me to it too.\n\nAgree or disagree? And tell me: what should the agent and I break down next week? Top comment gets built.\n\n#ai #contentcreator #buildinpublic #hottake #aitools #claudeai #creativity #digitalskills #makeitloud #techsouthafrica
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: Unpopular opinion: most AI content is noise
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-19-buhle-ai-made-simple
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260719T190000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:191500
SUMMARY:POST: Why your prompts fail
DESCRIPTION:Format: carousel | Pillar: prompts | Status: ready\n\nCAPTION:\nAI is a mirror. Weak brief in\, weak work out. Watch one real prompt grow from generic poison to the bio in my profile right now\, versions on slides 3 to 5.\n\nThen the challenge on slide 7: rewrite one of your own prompts tonight and comment the before and after. Best upgrade gets featured on my story this week.\n\nWeek one of the AI run page: done. The experiment continues.\n\n#promptengineering #aiprompts #ai #claudeai #learnai #aiforbeginners #digitalskills #contentcreation #buildinpublic #aitips
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post in 30 min: Why your prompts fail
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
